# Normalize text to LF in the repository. Everything here is built and
# run on Linux; a CRLF that reaches a shell script makes it unrunnable
# and a CRLF in go.mod churns the diff every time `go mod tidy` runs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets git shouldn't touch.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
